sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as 🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Patient
    participant PP as 📱 Patient Portal
    participant MS as 📹 Meeting Server
    participant JITSI as 🎥 Jitsi Meet
    participant STT as 🎤 Speech-to-Text
    participant AI as 🤖 Gemini AI
    participant DP as 💻 Doctor Portal
    participant D as 👨‍⚕️ Doctor
    participant DB as 🗄️ Database

    rect rgb(224, 247, 250)
        Note over P,D: 📅 PRE-MEETING SETUP
        P->>PP: Click "Join Meeting"
        D->>DP: Click "Start Consultation"
        PP->>MS: GET join-config (role=patient, Bearer session)
        DP->>MS: GET join-config (role=doctor, Bearer JWT)
        MS-->>PP: domain, roomName, displayName (member)
        MS-->>DP: domain, roomName, moderator/owner
        Note over MS,JITSI: meet.jit.si: no room JWT; doctor uses configOverwrite.moderator
        Note over MS,JITSI: Guest: scoped invite token required (GUEST_AUTH_REQUIRED)
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over PP,JITSI: 🎥 VIDEO CONNECTION
        PP->>JITSI: Connect (displayName from auth, prejoin off)
        DP->>JITSI: Connect (moderator/host)
        JITSI-->>PP: Room joined
        JITSI-->>DP: Room joined
        JITSI->>JITSI: WebRTC P2P established
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 225)
        Note over JITSI,AI: 🎤 REAL-TIME TRANSCRIPTION
        loop Every audio chunk
            JITSI->>MS: Audio stream
            MS->>STT: Process audio
            STT-->>MS: Text transcript
            MS->>DP: Live transcript update
            MS->>DB: Store transcript segment
        end
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note over D,AI: 🤖 AI SUMMARY GENERATION
        D->>DP: End consultation
        DP->>MS: Request summary
        MS->>DB: Get full transcript
        DB-->>MS: Transcript data
        MS->>AI: Generate clinical summary
        AI-->>MS: SOAP suggestions
        MS-->>DP: AI summary + suggestions
    end

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over D,DB: 📋 DOCUMENTATION
        D->>DP: Review & edit SOAP notes
        D->>DP: Add prescriptions
        D->>DP: Digital signature
        DP->>DB: Save encounter record
        DP->>DB: Save prescriptions
        DB->>PP: Notify patient
        PP->>P: "Records available" notification
    end
